        "page_or_item": "ProQuest Congressional Replica of Original, file PT1-1922-EO-3761.pdf (1 pages)",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "3176fd320982e134a13f36de0b83919d940225b3eb8cbf5936d926b0ffd75b42",
        "signing_date": "1922-12-06",
        "text_path": "jobs/pinakes-proquest-ingest/output/texts/EO_3761.txt",
        "text_sha256": "9d7d8d277fba7e393f043adc0c587f5b5bdf3928c896b055f908d4a642cd6438",
        "url": "https://congressional.proquest.com/congressional/docview/t67.d72.1922-eo-3761"
      },
      "text": "2. On deposit money orders issued prior to January 1, 1923, interest will\nbe paid as specified in Executive Order of October 22, 19 16, except that interest\nfor the period or periods of three full calendar months, ending subsequent to\nDecember 31, 1922, shah be paid at the rate of three fourths of one percentumi\nfor each of such periods."
    },
